OL,3,GNEWSAPlaque for scientist who helped
OL,4,Asaved millions
OL,5,
OL,6,FSheila Francis, professor of
OL,7,Fcardiovascular biology at the
OL,8,Funiversity, said Paine's "pioneering
OL,9,Fwork" was "little-known", but that it
OL,10,Fhad "helped pave the way for a
OL,11,Ftreatment that has saved millions of
OL,12,Flives".
